      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Deferred lighting is not fast enough, and furthermore... this script doesn't support VR. Any screen space volumetric lighting will look obviously fake in VR as well.\n\nThe simpler way to do it, which can be implemented now and looks great in VR, is to simply model light shafts and place them in your world. Combined with baked lighting, this is cheap and effective.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
